{"id":"u01","level":"A1","emoji":"👋","title":{"t":"Hallo!","s":"Hello!","a":"audio/de-en/0ce1112c3622.mp3"},"goals":["Greet people and say goodbye","Say your name and where you are from","Use sein: ich bin, du bist, er/sie ist, Sie sind","Know when to say du and when to say Sie"],"words":[{"id":"w01","t":"der Name","pl":"die Namen","s":"name","emoji":"📛","ex":{"t":"Mein Name ist Reza.","s":"My name is Reza.","a":"audio/de-en/d00170c739c4.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f4db.svg","a":"audio/de-en/43f11c626bf4.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/c62e5978a9c5.mp3"},{"id":"w02","t":"die Frau","pl":"die Frauen","s":"woman; Ms. / Mrs.","emoji":"👩","ex":{"t":"Frau Müller kommt aus Hamburg.","s":"Ms. Müller is from Hamburg.","a":"audio/de-en/7ab536658590.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f469.svg","a":"audio/de-en/02a6b38bcb97.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/4957b1077e0c.mp3"},{"id":"w03","t":"der Herr","pl":"die Herren","s":"gentleman; Mr.","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Guten Tag, Herr Schmidt!","s":"Hello, Mr. Schmidt!","a":"audio/de-en/85dd00d2fd21.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/d4bc225da316.mp3","pla":"audio/de-en/defb35ecf260.mp3"},{"id":"w04","t":"sein","s":"to be","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Ich bin Sara.","s":"I'm Sara.","a":"audio/de-en/595cffefd852.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/c9b56298a1bf.mp3"},{"id":"w05","t":"heißen","s":"to be called","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Ich heiße Ali.","s":"My name is Ali.","a":"audio/de-en/626a0882cd6c.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/9191bbf1fd9e.mp3"},{"id":"w06","t":"kommen","s":"to come","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Ich komme aus dem Iran.","s":"I'm from Iran.","a":"audio/de-en/c9bcce588653.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/0cc0326d1a40.mp3"},{"id":"w07","t":"aus","s":"from; out of","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Lukas kommt aus Berlin.","s":"Lukas is from Berlin.","a":"audio/de-en/458f90cf8fb4.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/013bc090b703.mp3"},{"id":"w08","t":"woher","s":"where … from","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Woher kommen Sie?","s":"Where are you from?","a":"audio/de-en/224d862ef7fb.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/5ae4d9939511.mp3"},{"id":"w09","t":"wer","s":"who","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Wer ist das?","s":"Who is that?","a":"audio/de-en/1be6deb70447.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/ff9e61b8dfd6.mp3"},{"id":"w10","t":"wie","s":"how","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Wie heißt du?","s":"What's your name?","a":"audio/de-en/da77fb55713e.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/ecf7cd49cbaa.mp3"},{"id":"w11","t":"Deutschland","s":"Germany","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Anna kommt aus Deutschland.","s":"Anna is from Germany.","a":"audio/de-en/3b2c07e127dd.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/157333b3ec2f.mp3"},{"id":"w12","t":"der Iran","s":"Iran","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Maryam ist aus dem Iran.","s":"Maryam is from Iran.","a":"audio/de-en/5e2d36472596.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/23ebeab149d6.mp3"},{"id":"w13","t":"gut","s":"good; well","emoji":"👍","ex":{"t":"Danke, gut!","s":"Fine, thanks!","a":"audio/de-en/14d472a2d376.mp3"},"img":"img/e/1f44d.svg","a":"audio/de-en/94d610a3cec7.mp3"},{"id":"w14","t":"auch","s":"also; too","emoji":"","ex":{"t":"Ich komme auch aus dem Iran.","s":"I'm from Iran, too.","a":"audio/de-en/8890cdead8b2.mp3"},"img":null,"a":"audio/de-en/d0a4700dafdc.mp3"}],"phrases":[{"id":"p01","t":"Guten Morgen!","s":"Good morning!","a":"audio/de-en/02e99bcaa2f7.mp3"},{"id":"p02","t":"Guten Tag!","s":"Hello! / Good day! (polite)","a":"audio/de-en/bf9c75c1d08c.mp3"},{"id":"p03","t":"Wie geht es Ihnen?","s":"How are you? (polite)","a":"audio/de-en/09ec3fe172a1.mp3"},{"id":"p04","t":"Wie geht's?","s":"How are you? / How's it going? (informal)","a":"audio/de-en/246606a7f92c.mp3"},{"id":"p05","t":"Danke, gut. Und dir?","s":"Fine, thanks. And you? (informal)","a":"audio/de-en/41414da30e64.mp3"},{"id":"p06","t":"Freut mich!","s":"Nice to meet you!","a":"audio/de-en/6f8a047f30c1.mp3"},{"id":"p07","t":"Auf Wiedersehen!","s":"Goodbye! (polite)","a":"audio/de-en/748bb94953c4.mp3"},{"id":"p08","t":"Tschüss!","s":"Bye! (informal)","a":"audio/de-en/074e4a47f9bb.mp3"}],"dialogue":{"title":{"t":"Im Deutschkurs","s":"In German class","a":"audio/de-en/b2f3be643b18.mp3"},"speakers":{"A":{"name":"Frau Müller","voice":"f"},"B":{"name":"Reza","voice":"m"}},"lines":[{"sp":"A","t":"Guten Tag! Ich bin Eva Müller. Wie heißen Sie?","s":"Hello! I'm Eva Müller. What's your name?","a":"audio/de-en/35d89d8baaac.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Guten Tag, Frau Müller! Ich heiße Reza Ahmadi.","s":"Hello, Ms. Müller! My name is Reza Ahmadi.","a":"audio/de-en/fe82a6020c9c.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Freut mich, Herr Ahmadi. Woher kommen Sie?","s":"Nice to meet you, Mr. Ahmadi. Where are you from?","a":"audio/de-en/a2e7c81b3948.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Ich komme aus dem Iran. Und Sie?","s":"I'm from Iran. And you?","a":"audio/de-en/3437f5b2d2b4.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Ich komme aus Deutschland, aus Hamburg.","s":"I'm from Germany, from Hamburg.","a":"audio/de-en/97a94b0e1bb0.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Wie geht es Ihnen, Frau Müller?","s":"How are you, Ms. Müller?","a":"audio/de-en/8d921546d0f2.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Danke, gut. Und Ihnen?","s":"Fine, thanks. And you?","a":"audio/de-en/d3606fc57896.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Auch gut, danke.","s":"Fine too, thanks.","a":"audio/de-en/88c92a438df5.mp3"},{"sp":"A","t":"Auf Wiedersehen, Herr Ahmadi!","s":"Goodbye, Mr. Ahmadi!","a":"audio/de-en/8404ffecc297.mp3"},{"sp":"B","t":"Auf Wiedersehen!","s":"Goodbye!","a":"audio/de-en/748bb94953c4.mp3"}]},"grammar":[{"id":"g01","title":{"t":"sein: ich bin, du bist …","s":"The verb \"to be\""},"explain":"The verb **sein** means *to be*. It is irregular, so just learn the forms by heart.\nUse **ich bin** for yourself, **du bist** for a friend or a child, and **er ist** / **sie ist** for another person (er = he, sie = she, es = it).\n**Sie sind** is the polite *you* for adults you don't know well. Polite **Sie** always starts with a capital S.\nWith **sein** you can say who you are and where you are from: **Ich bin Sara. Ich bin aus dem Iran.**","table":[["ich","bin","Ich bin Sara."],["du","bist","Du bist Lukas."],["er / sie / es","ist","Er ist aus Berlin."],["Sie","sind","Sind Sie Frau Müller?"]],"examples":[{"t":"Ich bin Reza.","s":"I'm Reza.","a":"audio/de-en/5557280f3a12.mp3"},{"t":"Du bist Anna.","s":"You are Anna.","a":"audio/de-en/26a05fe880b7.mp3"},{"t":"Das ist Maryam. Sie ist aus dem Iran.","s":"This is Maryam. She is from Iran.","a":"audio/de-en/31ddbf117a26.mp3"},{"t":"Sind Sie Herr Schmidt?","s":"Are you Mr. Schmidt?","a":"audio/de-en/f8a16622edaf.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"Ich ___ Sara.","options":["bin","bist","ist"],"answer":0,"s":"I'm Sara.","full":"Ich bin Sara.","a":"audio/de-en/595cffefd852.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Lukas ___ aus Deutschland.","options":["bist","ist","sind"],"answer":1,"s":"Lukas is from Germany.","full":"Lukas ist aus Deutschland.","a":"audio/de-en/8e796ece7a6a.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Frau Müller, ___ Sie aus Hamburg?","options":["sind","ist","bist"],"answer":0,"s":"Ms. Müller, are you from Hamburg?","full":"Frau Müller, sind Sie aus Hamburg?","a":"audio/de-en/5d4a70b59884.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Du ___ Ali.","answer":["bist"],"s":"You are Ali.","full":"Du bist Ali.","a":"audio/de-en/fd9348da0449.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Das ___ Maryam.","answer":["ist"],"s":"This is Maryam.","full":"Das ist Maryam.","a":"audio/de-en/ffde433ac20d.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Ich bin aus dem Iran.","s":"I'm from Iran.","full":"Ich bin aus dem Iran.","a":"audio/de-en/396f99d5701b.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Sind Sie Herr Schmidt?","s":"Are you Mr. Schmidt?","full":"Sind Sie Herr Schmidt?","a":"audio/de-en/f8a16622edaf.mp3"}]},{"id":"g02","title":{"t":"heißen, kommen – du oder Sie?","s":"heißen, kommen – du or Sie?"},"explain":"To say your name, use **ich heiße** (from heißen, *to be called*). To ask someone's name: **Wie heißt du?** (informal) or **Wie heißen Sie?** (polite).\nGerman has two words for *you*. Use **du** with family, friends and children. Use **Sie** with adults you don't know, at work, in offices, and with **Frau** / **Herr** + family name.\nTo ask where someone is from: **Woher kommst du?** / **Woher kommen Sie?** – **Ich komme aus Deutschland.** Most countries have no article, but a few do: **aus dem Iran**, **aus der Türkei**. Just learn these as fixed phrases.\nIn a question with a question word (**wie**, **woher**, **wer**), the verb comes second: **Woher kommen Sie?**","table":[["ich","heiße","komme"],["du","heißt","kommst"],["er / sie / es","heißt","kommt"],["Sie","heißen","kommen"]],"examples":[{"t":"Wie heißt du? – Ich heiße Amir.","s":"What's your name? – My name is Amir.","a":"audio/de-en/5a32aa2d423e.mp3"},{"t":"Wie heißen Sie? – Ich heiße Eva Müller.","s":"What's your name? – My name is Eva Müller.","a":"audio/de-en/f8a8d7bc3dd7.mp3"},{"t":"Woher kommst du? – Ich komme aus dem Iran.","s":"Where are you from? – I'm from Iran.","a":"audio/de-en/ac034ba06ea1.mp3"},{"t":"Woher kommen Sie, Herr Schmidt?","s":"Where are you from, Mr. Schmidt?","a":"audio/de-en/d8be7ed23316.mp3"},{"t":"Lukas kommt aus Berlin.","s":"Lukas is from Berlin.","a":"audio/de-en/458f90cf8fb4.mp3"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","t":"Wie ___ Sie?","options":["heißen","heißt","heiße"],"answer":0,"s":"What's your name? (polite)","full":"Wie heißen Sie?","a":"audio/de-en/635c0c7fab98.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Woher ___ du?","options":["kommst","kommen","komme"],"answer":0,"s":"Where are you from?","full":"Woher kommst du?","a":"audio/de-en/507b2927438c.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Herr Schmidt, woher ___ Sie?","options":["kommst","kommen","kommt"],"answer":1,"s":"Mr. Schmidt, where are you from?","full":"Herr Schmidt, woher kommen Sie?","a":"audio/de-en/490dc329da80.mp3"},{"type":"choice","t":"Guten Tag, Frau Müller! Wie geht es ___?","options":["dir","Ihnen"],"answer":1,"s":"Hello, Ms. Müller! How are you?","full":"Guten Tag, Frau Müller! Wie geht es Ihnen?","a":"audio/de-en/02d2ef8e49d6.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Wie ___ du?","answer":["heißt"],"s":"What's your name?","full":"Wie heißt du?","a":"audio/de-en/da77fb55713e.mp3"},{"type":"type","t":"Lukas ___ aus Deutschland.","answer":["kommt","ist"],"s":"Lukas is from Germany.","full":"Lukas kommt aus Deutschland.","a":"audio/de-en/96b2e1cb283e.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Woher kommen Sie?","s":"Where are you from? (polite)","full":"Woher kommen Sie?","a":"audio/de-en/224d862ef7fb.mp3"},{"type":"order","t":"Ich heiße Maryam Karimi.","s":"My name is Maryam Karimi.","full":"Ich heiße Maryam Karimi.","a":"audio/de-en/178b0b1f9ff3.mp3"}]}],"reading":{"title":{"t":"Hallo, ich bin Sara!","s":"Hello, I'm Sara!","a":"audio/de-en/86a0b55b7c95.mp3"},"text":[{"t":"Hallo! Ich heiße Sara.","s":"Hello! My name is Sara.","a":"audio/de-en/a5413b161ebd.mp3"},{"t":"Ich komme aus dem Iran, aus Teheran.","s":"I'm from Iran, from Tehran.","a":"audio/de-en/bc9e7fd4339e.mp3"},{"t":"Das ist Lukas.","s":"This is Lukas.","a":"audio/de-en/28e280372a6b.mp3"},{"t":"Lukas kommt aus Deutschland, aus Berlin.","s":"Lukas is from Germany, from Berlin.","a":"audio/de-en/01aab79add92.mp3"},{"t":"Und das ist Frau Müller.","s":"And this is Ms. Müller.","a":"audio/de-en/2091b2127db5.mp3"},{"t":"Frau Müller kommt auch aus Deutschland.","s":"Ms. Müller is also from Germany.","a":"audio/de-en/998c93950812.mp3"},{"t":"Sie ist aus Hamburg.","s":"She is from Hamburg.","a":"audio/de-en/70a4493f449d.mp3"},{"t":"Und du? Wie heißt du? Woher kommst du?","s":"And you? What's your name? Where are you from?","a":"audio/de-en/a0a7c10170bd.mp3"}],"questions":[{"q":{"t":"Woher kommt Sara?","s":"Where is Sara from?","a":"audio/de-en/fc4229848515.mp3"},"options":["aus dem Iran","aus Deutschland","aus Hamburg"],"answer":0},{"q":{"t":"Wer kommt aus Berlin?","s":"Who is from Berlin?","a":"audio/de-en/2884c4645689.mp3"},"options":["Lukas","Sara","Frau Müller"],"answer":0},{"q":{"t":"Woher kommt Frau Müller?","s":"Where is Ms. Müller from?","a":"audio/de-en/2630c6c530eb.mp3"},"options":["aus Teheran","aus Berlin","aus Hamburg"],"answer":2}]},"sentences":[{"t":"Ich heiße Ali.","s":"My name is Ali.","a":"audio/de-en/626a0882cd6c.mp3"},{"t":"Wie heißen Sie?","s":"What's your name? (polite)","a":"audio/de-en/635c0c7fab98.mp3"},{"t":"Woher kommst du?","s":"Where are you from? (informal)","a":"audio/de-en/507b2927438c.mp3"},{"t":"Ich komme aus dem Iran.","s":"I'm from Iran.","a":"audio/de-en/c9bcce588653.mp3"},{"t":"Das ist Frau Müller.","s":"This is Ms. Müller.","a":"audio/de-en/b86c4972bc8c.mp3"},{"t":"Lukas ist aus Berlin.","s":"Lukas is from Berlin.","a":"audio/de-en/8ed91e11b885.mp3"},{"t":"Freut mich, Herr Schmidt!","s":"Nice to meet you, Mr. Schmidt!","a":"audio/de-en/b95a9d7d503c.mp3"},{"t":"Wie geht es Ihnen?","s":"How are you? (polite)","a":"audio/de-en/09ec3fe172a1.mp3"}],"img":"img/e/1f44b.svg"}